    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i want to be anchored. everything is just so hollow. it feels less like i'm losing myself and more like there's nothing left to find. like the person i used to be is just... gone. what's the point of trying to grab onto something that isn't even there anymore?",
